   ],
   "genuine_ms_gene_hits": 0
  },
  "verdict": "DROP \u2014 definitive negative.",
  "justification": "EvoWeb is exclusively prokaryotic. 100% of its 3,269,864 protein members are NCBI RefSeq WP_ accessions (non-redundant bacterial/archaeal proteins); there are zero NP_/XP_ human proteins, no gene symbols, no taxon, disease, ontology or human identifier of any kind. Its only content is co-evolution clusters of bacterial protein families, so it has no join key to a human disease analysis. The 11 label matches for MS gene symbols are all substring artefacts inside bacterial protein names."
 },
